      "v": 4,
      "zh": "你是谁，竟论断别人的仆人呢？他或站住或跌倒，自有他的主人在；而且他也必要站住，因为主能使他站住。",
      "en": "Who are you to pass judgment on another’s servant? Before his own master he stands or falls. And he will stand, for the Lord[NOTE:1] is able to make him stand.",
